---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Transparency Statement • November 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700">
      <p>NomadMatrix believes in complete transparency with our readers and the global digital nomad community.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">1. How We Keep Our Database 100% Free</h2>
      <p>Researching, monitoring, and updating immigration policies across 40+ countries requires ongoing engineering and legal tracking work. We keep this service accessible to everyone without paywalling basic requirements through selected partner affiliations.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">2. SafetyWing Insurance Partnership</h2>
      <p>Some outbound links on this site (such as our travel and nomad insurance recommendations for SafetyWing) are affiliate tracking links. When you purchase insurance through these links, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. In fact, many partner links offer exclusive rates or extended benefits.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">3. Editorial Independence</h2>
      <p>Our editorial integrity remains uncompromised. We present verified minimum income thresholds, official processing times, and accurate tax calculations regardless of whether a partner relationship exists.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
